capability httpRequestReader http.request read
purpose operation httpRequestReader "Authority to inspect incoming auth request headers and bounded bodies."
capability httpResponseWriter http.response write
purpose operation httpResponseWriter "Authority to write auth route HTTP response headers and bodies."
capability heapAllocCapability heap allocate
purpose operation heapAllocCapability "Authority to allocate per-request auth JSON and token scratch buffers."
capability heapFreeCapability heap free
purpose operation heapFreeCapability "Authority to release per-request auth JSON and token scratch buffers."
capability memoryBufferReadWriteCapability memory.buffer readWrite
purpose operation memoryBufferReadWriteCapability "Authority to read parsed auth buffers, compare bearer strings, and wipe password scratch memory."
capability jsonDocumentReadCapability json.document.tree read
purpose operation jsonDocumentReadCapability "Authority to read parsed auth JSON document cursors."
capability jsonDocumentWriteCapability json.document.tree write
purpose operation jsonDocumentWriteCapability "Authority to create and destroy per-request auth JSON documents."
capability bcryptHashCompute bcrypt.hash compute
purpose operation bcryptHashCompute "Authority to verify login passwords and hash or verify refresh tokens through the native bcrypt runtime."
capability jwtTokenSigner jwt.hs256 signVerify
purpose operation jwtTokenSigner "Authority to issue and verify HS256 access tokens through the native JWT runtime."
capability sqliteDatabaseReadWriter database readWrite
purpose operation sqliteDatabaseReadWriter "Authority to persist auth rate-limit and audit rows through standard.sqlite."
capability processEnvironmentReader process.environment read
purpose operation processEnvironmentReader "Authority to read deployment auth configuration from process environment variables."

