purpose operation authRefreshHandler "Verify the current refresh token against its process-local bcrypt hash and rotate both auth tokens."
invariant operation authRefreshHandler "The plaintext refresh token is returned only once; subsequent refresh/logout checks use the stored bcrypt hash."
